You see, a car like this
likes a bit of off-road action.

754
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:24,440
[笑声]
[LAUGHTER]

755
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:26,120
我觉得太精彩了。
I think it was fantastic.

756
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:28,160
女士们先生们，乔纳森·罗斯！
[掌声]
Ladies and gentlemen, Jonathan Ross!
[APPLAUSE]

757
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:31,360
玩得太痛快了，真的超级过瘾。
Had a wonderful time. It was great fun.

758
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:35,360
那么，大家也知道，
Now, as you know,

