We've got two new challenges.

764
00:32:45,280 --> 00:32:48,120
我们要寻找全英国开得最快的贵族老爷，
We're looking for Britain's fastest Lord

765
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:52,160
还要寻找全英国开得最快的小货车司机。
and we're looking for Britain's fastest
white van driver.

766
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:54,840
没开玩笑，认真的。所以，要是你常在“坎伯兰公爵”酒馆喝酒，
No, really. So, if you drink
in the Duke of Cumberland

