769
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:02,080
《Top Gear》，伍德巷。基本上整个伍德巷都算。
Top Gear, Wood Lane.
All of Wood Lane, basically.

770
00:33:02,120 --> 00:33:04,560
伦敦，W12邮区，整片W12都归我们。
London, W12, all of W12.

