whatever they are.

800
00:34:46,160 --> 00:34:50,360
但最终的效果是，
车厢里安静得让人有些发毛。
But the result is,
it is spookily quiet in here.

801
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:52,120
说实在的，我很好奇……
In fact, I wonder how...

802
00:34:52,160 --> 00:34:55,080
我们到底得开到多快，
才会有哪怕一丁点噪音，
How fast we've actually got to go
before there's any noise

803
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:57,760
来佐证我们还在移动？因为我现在唯一的证据，
to back up the only other evidence
I've got that we're moving,

804
00:34:57,800 --> 00:35:00,640
就只有窗外飞速倒退的风景。
which is scenery flashing past the windows.

805
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:02,440
曼弗雷德，麻烦深踩一脚油门！
Manfred, step on it, please!

806
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,920
多谢。
Thank you.

807
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:08,560
得咧，现在时速150英里，还是鸦雀无声。
All right. We're doing 150, no noise.

808
00:35:08,600 --> 00:35:11,480
我之所以知道车速，
是因为头顶上就嵌着个速度表，
I know how fast we're going,
because I've got a speedo up there

