But most of that length is taken up with
providing interior accommodation.

828
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:09,560
型号里的62，代表它长达6.2米。
62 stands for 6.2m long.

829
00:36:09,600 --> 00:36:12,720
他们肯定是料定买主不仅富可敌国，
身形也得高大如巨人，
And they must expect customers to be
as tall as they're rich,

830
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:16,560
不过前排司机的待遇倒也不至于像蹲在包装木箱上受罪。
though the chauffeur is
hardly left perched on a packing crate.

831
00:36:16,600 --> 00:36:18,080
我把耳朵贴向前排仔细听了听，
I'm listening at the front,

832
00:36:18,120 --> 00:36:21,040
这可是当今世上马力最强劲的量产发动机。
this is the world's
most powerful production engine.

833
00:36:21,080 --> 00:36:22,880
我觉得它应该启动着呢。
And I think it's running.

834
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:25,520
没错，热浪都涌上来了，确实在运转。
Yeah, there's heat coming off it.
It's running.

835
00:36:25,540 --> 00:36:28,540
♪ Suede - Streetlife ♪
♪ Suede - Streetlife ♪

836
00:36:29,080 --> 00:36:32,320
被娇惯在这间简直该被尊称为“沙龙”里的乘客，
Passengers cossetted in what
begs to be called the salon,

837
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:35,800
只需轻按一下电钮，
便可仰望星空，或是将苍穹彻底隔绝。
can gaze into the heavens or dismiss them
at the touch of a button.

838
00:36:35,840 --> 00:36:37,960
这全仰仗那块光电感应天窗。
Thanks to a photo-electric sunroof.

839
00:36:37,980 --> 00:36:41,500
♪ 街头生活，遁入黑夜 ♪
♪ 伴随着切分的律动旋律 ♪
♪ Street life, into the night ♪
♪ with the syncopated melodies ♪

840
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:48,000
♪ 街头生活，左顾右盼 ♪
♪ 你的双唇宛如画报女郎般性感迷人 ♪
♪ Street life, look left look right ♪
♪ you've got the lips from a magazine ♪

841
00:36:49,240 --> 00:36:50,480
我不知道。
I don't know.

842
00:36:50,520 --> 00:36:54,560
花了快三十万英镑，外观看起来
