00:55:40,960 --> 00:55:42,960
再拿一个Metro的雨刷电机
and used a Metro windscreen wiper motor

1255
00:55:43,000 --> 00:55:44,760
当做齿轮凸轮
来把它拨动一圈。
as a kind of a cog
to actually flick it round.

1256
00:55:44,800 --> 00:55:46,360
塑料手指？
- 所以它们才变成了……
额，反正你懂的。
Plastic finger?
- So that's how they become...
Yeah, well, you know.

1257
00:55:46,400 --> 00:55:47,960
非常有邦德范儿。
Very Bond.

1258
00:55:48,000 --> 00:55:49,560
好嘞，我觉得
这部分算是彻底搞定了。
Right well, that seemed
pretty much sorted I'd say.

1259
00:55:49,600 --> 00:55:51,520
那这边这位仁兄怎么办？
What about this fella here?

1260
00:55:51,560 --> 00:55:53,040
呃，他这个就有点棘手了。
Well, he's a bit more tricky.

1261
00:55:53,080 --> 00:55:54,120
我的意思是，按理说正常社交礼仪
会建议
I mean, obviously, normally,
etiquette would suggest

1262
00:55:54,160 --> 00:55:56,160
你应该礼貌地请他下车，
you should ask him politely to leave,

1263
00:55:56,200 --> 00:55:57,560
但要是好说歹说都不管用，
那显然，我们该做的
but if then none of those work,
then obviously, what we need to do

1264
00:55:57,600 --> 00:55:59,240
就是自己先撤离这辆车。
is vacate the vehicle ourselves.

1265
00:55:59,280 --> 00:56:01,160
行。
- 因为我们袖子里
还藏着一手绝活。
Right.
- As we have another
little trick up our sleeves.

1266
00:56:01,200 --> 00:56:02,720
噢，懂了。准没好事发生！
Oh, right. Something
awful's going to happen!

1267
00:56:02,760 --> 00:56:05,040
可不是嘛。我们得做的是
把这个抓在手里。
It is. What we need to do
is grab hold of this.

1268
00:56:05,080 --> 00:56:06,400
那座椅是湿的，艾德！
That seat was wet, Edd!

1269
00:56:06,440 --> 00:56:08,440
对不住啊。看你玩得挺享受嘛。
I'm sorry. You're obviously
enjoying yourself.

1270
00:56:08,480 --> 00:56:10,320
我手里拿了个门铃！
- 可不是嘛。
I've got a doorbell!
- We have.

1271
00:56:10,360 --> 00:56:12,840
还是个黄铜门铃呢。
真是不惜血本。
[观众笑声]
It's a brass doorbell.
It's no expense spared.
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

1272
00:56:12,880 --> 00:56:15,640
所以，我觉得咱们得
离这辆车再远一点。
So, I think we need to get a little bit
further away from the vehicle.

1273
00:56:15,680 --> 00:56:17,280
到底要离多远，艾德？
Exactly how far, Edd?

1274
00:56:17,320 --> 00:56:18,600
呃，比现在还得再远点。
Well, a little bit more than that.

1275
00:56:18,640 --> 00:56:20,680
那到底有多危……
[笑声]
So how dangerous...
[LAUGHTER]

1276
00:56:20,720 --> 00:56:23,320
这玩意儿到底有多危险？
- 我觉得可能还得
再往后退一点。
How dangerous is this?
- Possibly little bit
more than that I think.

1277
00:56:23,360 --> 00:56:24,760
那大概就是……
That would probably be...

1278
00:56:24,800 --> 00:56:26,400
我能退到观众席那么远吗？
Can I be as far as the audience?

1279
00:56:26,440 --> 00:56:27,920
因为他们看着挺安全的。
- 这倒是个好主意。
'Cause they look safe.
- That might be not a bad idea.

1280
00:56:27,960 --> 00:56:30,760
行。然后，就是按这上面的按钮了。
Right. So, and then it's this button here.

1281
00:56:30,800 --> 00:56:32,360
对，我是说，再问他最后一次。
Yeah. I mean, ask him one more time.

1282
00:56:32,400 --> 00:56:34,080
这位反派，能劳烦您从我车上下去吗？
Would you mind leaving my car, villain?

1283
00:56:34,120 --> 00:56:36,400
不肯？行，尝尝这个！
No? Right. Have this!

1284
00:56:37,960 --> 00:56:39,520
嘿！
Hey!

1285
00:56:39,560 --> 00:56:42,600
[笑声与掌声]
[LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE]

1286
00:56:45,000 --> 00:56:47,700
哈蒙德：太棒了！
HAMMOND: That was fantastic!

1287
00:56:56,800 --> 00:56:59,600
太精彩了！还有你也是，
你演得绝了。
Fantastic! And you as well,
you were wonderful.

1288
00:56:59,640 --> 00:57:02,240
呃，好了，总算把他给解决了。
Erm, right, so we've got rid of him.

1289
00:57:02,280 --> 00:57:05,160
解决了，暴力手段用过了。
- 你可还留了最后一招。
We have. We've done violence.
- You've got one more trick left.

1290
00:57:05,200 --> 00:57:07,120
确实动粗了。
- 接下来得整点毁天灭地的烈火大场面。
We have done violence.
- We need fire and brimstone next.

1291
00:57:07,160 --> 00:57:08,800
不赖。
- 而且任何一辆邦德座驾
Nice.
- And no Bond car would be complete

1292
00:57:08,840 --> 00:57:10,320
要是没配个火箭，那都不叫完整。
without some kind of rocket.

1293
00:57:10,360 --> 00:57:12,200
行，那这个是……这个是……
Okay, now this is... This is...

1294
00:57:12,240 --> 00:57:13,960
呃，这根本就是根下水排水管嘛，埃德。
Well, this is a drainpipe, Ed.

1295
00:57:14,000 --> 00:57:16,080
还真是排水管。你说得没错。
眼神真毒啊。
It is a drainpipe. You're right.
Very well-spotted there.

1296
00:57:16,120 --> 00:57:18,000
哈蒙德：这玩意儿咱们自己在家
也能照着鼓捣一个。
HAMMOND: Something we can
have a go at at home for ourselves.

1297
00:57:18,040 --> 00:57:19,880
呃，确实，不过你当然需要……
Well, it is, well,
what you need, of course,

1298
00:57:19,920 --> 00:57:21,880
咱们这枚“燃油清洁导弹”。
is our fuel-cleaning missile.

1299
00:57:21,920 --> 00:57:24,840
行吧，好吧。这算某种火箭。
Right. Okay. This is some sort of rocket.

1300
00:57:24,880 --> 00:57:26,800
当然了，在开车的过程中，
随时可能
Of course, also, there is always
the opportunity

1301
00:57:26,840 --> 00:57:28,920
遇到需要用到这玩意儿的情况。
when you're driving along, you might
actually have to have one of these.

1302
00:57:28,960 --> 00:57:30,680
当然，你还得配个防风打火机。
Of course, you need a windproof lighter.

1303
00:57:30,720 --> 00:57:33,200
哟，你想得可真周到！
那我这也备了一个。
Oh, you've thought of everything!
So I've got one of these.

1304
00:57:33,240 --> 00:57:34,440
你那边也有一个是吧？
- 必须有。
You got one on your side, have you?
- I have indeed.

1305
00:57:34,480 --> 00:57:36,080
所以你只要打开这个小——
So what you have to do is open this little-

1306
00:57:36,120 --> 00:57:38,920
然后把这个塞进去。
- 塞进去，点着。我绕到
And put this in.
- Pop it in. Light it. I'll go around

1307
00:57:38,960 --> 00:57:40,760
另一边，去弄同样的。
to the other side, and do the same.

1308
00:57:40,800 --> 00:57:41,960
趁你绕过去，
我也把护目镜戴上。
I'll put my goggles on as well,
while you get around.

1309
00:57:42,000 --> 00:57:43,280
这主意不错。
- 相当讲究。
That's not a bad idea.
- That's very neat.

1310
00:57:43,320 --> 00:57:44,760
我戴这副。
I'll put these on.

1311
00:57:44,800 --> 00:57:47,800
我觉得邦德平时一般不戴这种玩意儿。
I don't think Bond wears these generally.

1312
00:57:47,840 --> 00:57:49,760
啊哈！
- 安全第一嘛，诸如此类的。
Ah!
- Safety first and all that.

1313
00:57:49,800 --> 00:57:51,880
我觉得我这副可比你的帅气多了。
I think mine are much smarter than yours.

1314
00:57:51,920 --> 00:57:54,240
我就喜欢这绿色镜片。
- 防风打火机，太特么机智了！
I like my green tint.
- Windproof, that's genius!

1315
00:57:54,280 --> 00:57:56,120
准备好了？好，妥了。
Ready? Okay. Right.

1316
00:57:56,160 --> 00:57:57,920
我要点了。
- 这玩意儿真的会……
I'm going.
- This is really gonna do...

1317
00:57:57,960 --> 00:57:59,480
埃德：我觉得咱们可能
得往后退一点。
EDD: I think we might
have to stand back a bit.

1318
00:57:59,520 --> 00:58:01,880
我要退到八丈远开外去。
I'm going to stand back a very long way.

1319
00:58:06,760 --> 00:58:09,760
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

1320
00:58:09,800 --> 00:58:12,000
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

1321
00:58:12,800 --> 00:58:14,800
噢，快看！
Oh, look!

1322
00:58:16,800 --> 00:58:21,000
埃德！埃德，太棒了！
Edd! Edd, that was fantastic.

1323
00:58:22,480 --> 00:58:24,240
恐怕今天节目就只能到这儿了。
And I'm afraid we have to end it there.

1324
00:58:24,280 --> 00:58:26,480
咱们这儿有一大堆烂摊子要收拾，
We've got a lot of tidying up to do here,

1325
00:58:26,520 --> 00:58:28,440
坦白说，其实到处都得打扫。
and everywhere, frankly.

1326
00:58:28,480 --> 00:58:30,280
我们还得去买点鲜花、
弄几个靠垫，再摆点熏香干花，
And we've got to get some flowers and
some cushions and some potpourri

1327
00:58:30,320 --> 00:58:34,000
因为下周会有几位姑娘
来咱们节目做客。
'cause we've got some girls
coming on the show next week.

1328
00:58:34,040 --> 00:58:35,960
呃，不过别慌！我们还会带来一台
Er, but don't worry! We've also got

1329
00:58:36,000 --> 00:58:39,720
5.5升机械增压
V8发动机的梅赛德斯。
a five-and-a-half litre
super-charged V8 Mercedes.

1330
00:58:39,760 --> 00:58:43,000
咱们到时见，晚安！
So, we'll see you then. Good night!

1331
